23
00:02:31,943 --> 00:02:33,278
[scoffs]

24
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:37,199
Your victims lost 100 billion won,
so how do you not have any money?

25
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:40,869
Who the hell are you assholes?

26
00:02:43,038 --> 00:02:44,956
Gangha Violent Crime Investigation Team 1.

27
00:02:45,916 --> 00:02:47,250
-[scoffs]
-[both chuckle]

28
00:02:47,834 --> 00:02:49,211
Jeez.

29
00:02:49,294 --> 00:02:51,088
You followed us all the way here?

30
00:02:51,171 --> 00:02:54,091
[mariachero] Exactly. Why did I
have to come all the way here?

31
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:57,094
Because of you guys,
I rented this entire place

32
00:02:57,177 --> 00:02:59,137
