-[all grunting]

74
00:04:39,946 --> 00:04:41,239
[groans]

75
00:04:41,323 --> 00:04:42,324
[grunting]

76
00:04:44,659 --> 00:04:46,119
Out of the way!

77
00:04:49,414 --> 00:04:50,624
[grunting]

78
00:04:52,250 --> 00:04:53,668
-[groans]
-[thuds]

79
00:04:53,752 --> 00:04:54,795
[grunts]

80
00:04:55,962 --> 00:04:57,380
