81
00:04:57,464 --> 00:04:58,965
[men groaning]

82
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:01,009
God damn it.

83
00:05:01,092 --> 00:05:02,844
-[gunshot]
-[patrons screaming]

84
00:05:02,928 --> 00:05:04,638
